1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,302
Meiosis two.

2
00:00:01,302 --> 00:00:07,669
The male makes four spermatids, which are remodelled into four sperms by spermiogenesis.

3
00:00:07,669 --> 00:00:18,138
The female makes one ovum and another polar body, and the first polar body may divide too: one ovum and three polar bodies, which soon die.

